WEBVTT

00:00.291 --> 00:03.294
That mask is a mark.

00:03.378 --> 00:06.339
I've gobbled up every single person
that wore that kind of mask.

00:24.607 --> 00:25.859
Total Concentration Breathing.

00:26.192 --> 00:27.569
Breath of Water.

00:32.323 --> 00:33.491
First Form...

00:41.583 --> 00:42.792
Water Surface Slash!

03:43.431 --> 03:44.724
Urokodaki.

03:55.276 --> 03:58.363
Damn it!

03:59.364 --> 04:02.533
My body is starting to disintegrate.

04:02.992 --> 04:04.661
I can't stop it.

04:12.669 --> 04:14.003
Damn it.

04:14.420 --> 04:18.424
The last thing I saw
was the face of a demon slayer.

04:24.514 --> 04:27.183
Why did this happen?

04:32.272 --> 04:33.564
I'm so scared.

04:33.731 --> 04:35.608
I'm scared of being alone at night.

04:37.986 --> 04:40.321
Brother, where are you?

04:42.782 --> 04:45.076
Hold my hand now.

04:45.159 --> 04:46.911
Just like how you always do.

04:48.204 --> 04:49.455
Why?

04:49.956 --> 04:54.002
Why did I kill my brother?

04:56.212 --> 04:57.255
That's odd.

04:58.214 --> 05:00.883
Who is "brother"?

05:08.641 --> 05:10.101
The smell of sadness.

05:23.197 --> 05:25.700
God, I beg you.

05:31.914 --> 05:34.250
When this person is reborn,

05:35.668 --> 05:38.546
I hope you won't let him become a demon.

05:40.631 --> 05:42.175
Brother!

05:42.467 --> 05:44.552
Brother!

05:44.761 --> 05:46.679
Can you hold my hand?

05:48.306 --> 05:49.932
You're hopeless.

05:50.391 --> 05:52.560
You're always so timid.

06:16.000 --> 06:17.043
Sabito.

06:17.168 --> 06:18.169
Makomo.

06:19.003 --> 06:22.131
And the other children who were murdered.

06:23.341 --> 06:24.425
I won.

06:25.301 --> 06:26.761
Please rest in peace.

06:36.771 --> 06:39.732
You can fulfill your promise to go home.

06:40.566 --> 06:42.276
Although you're only left with your soul,

06:42.819 --> 06:44.070
go back to Sagiri Mountain.

06:50.993 --> 06:53.204
Go back to your beloved Master Urokodaki.

07:00.253 --> 07:04.006
If I die, my soul will return too.

07:19.522 --> 07:20.898
I have a question for you.

07:21.649 --> 07:25.319
What should I do to turn a demon back
into a human form?

07:37.373 --> 07:38.708
Tell me

07:39.459 --> 07:40.626
the way

07:41.878 --> 07:44.005
to turn Nezuko back into human.

08:21.542 --> 08:23.002
Wisteria.

08:26.214 --> 08:27.507
I survived.

08:43.981 --> 08:45.358
Only four people left.

08:45.900 --> 08:47.652
There were 20 people at first.

08:49.070 --> 08:50.404
That guy didn't make it too.

08:52.698 --> 08:55.826
It was because I fainted back then.

08:57.245 --> 08:58.621
I didn't manage to save him.

09:00.248 --> 09:02.583
I'm going to die.

09:03.543 --> 09:06.504
Even if I'm alive now, I'll still die.

09:07.755 --> 09:09.465
-Welcome back, everyone.
-Welcome back, everyone.

09:15.388 --> 09:17.014
Congratulations, everyone.

09:17.932 --> 09:19.684
Thank goodness, you're all fine.

09:20.601 --> 09:24.230
What should I do next?

09:24.981 --> 09:26.148
Where's the sword?

09:26.899 --> 09:30.361
First of all, please accept
the distribution of uniforms.

09:31.153 --> 09:33.197
We'll take your body measurement.

09:33.406 --> 09:36.784
After that, the rank will be engraved.

09:37.702 --> 09:40.788
There's a total of ten ranks.

09:41.205 --> 09:42.164
Kinoe.

09:42.248 --> 09:43.291
Kinoto.

09:43.374 --> 09:44.292
Hinoe.

09:44.375 --> 09:45.334
Hinoto.

09:45.418 --> 09:46.335
Tsuchinoe.

09:46.544 --> 09:47.628
Tsuchinoto.

09:47.712 --> 09:48.629
Kanoe.

09:48.796 --> 09:49.755
Kanoto.

09:49.839 --> 09:50.840
Mizunoe.

09:51.007 --> 09:52.258
Mizunoto.

09:52.842 --> 09:57.722
Everyone is currently
in the lowest rank, Mizunoto.

09:58.598 --> 09:59.849
Where's the sword?

10:00.474 --> 10:03.477
For the steel to be used in sword making,

10:03.561 --> 10:05.980
please choose an ore today.

10:06.314 --> 10:10.818
The sword-making process
will take 10 to 15 days to complete.

10:11.027 --> 10:11.902
What?

10:11.986 --> 10:13.154
Before we begin...

10:21.996 --> 10:26.917
A Kasugai Crow
will follow you from now on.

10:27.960 --> 10:30.212
Kasugai Crow?

10:30.963 --> 10:35.509
Kasugai Crow is a crow
primarily used for communication.

10:36.344 --> 10:37.470
Crow?

10:38.054 --> 10:39.639
Isn't this a sparrow?

10:39.722 --> 10:41.223
Are you kidding me?

10:46.812 --> 10:49.815
I don't care about the crow!

10:55.154 --> 10:57.531
The sword, I want it.

10:57.823 --> 10:59.950
Give me the sword now.

11:00.117 --> 11:02.078
I want Demon Slayer Corps' sword.

11:02.286 --> 11:04.163
The color-changing sword!

11:08.626 --> 11:10.169
Let go of the child now.

11:10.586 --> 11:12.505
If you don't, I'll break your arm.

11:14.340 --> 11:16.050
Who the hell are you?

11:17.259 --> 11:18.886
What should we do?

11:19.136 --> 11:20.721
Do it if you have the guts.

11:40.825 --> 11:43.119
Are you done talking?

11:50.584 --> 11:55.172
Please choose an ore, everyone.

11:57.341 --> 11:59.260
The steel of the sword

11:59.427 --> 12:02.388
is used to kill demons
and protect yourself.

12:02.596 --> 12:04.765
Please choose, everyone.

12:05.182 --> 12:08.185
I'll probably die immediately.

12:14.608 --> 12:16.402
Even if I were to choose,

12:17.153 --> 12:18.904
I don't know which one I should choose.

12:20.448 --> 12:22.783
It's my first time seeing ores.

12:23.284 --> 12:25.911
I can't make a judgment
from their exterior.

12:28.247 --> 12:30.040
I have no idea which one is better.

12:50.394 --> 12:51.562
I see.

12:55.191 --> 12:57.234
There were five survivors.

12:58.235 --> 12:59.695
How excellent.

13:01.906 --> 13:04.658
Our children have grown
in numbers yet again.

13:05.659 --> 13:07.953
I wonder what kind of swordsmen
they will become.

13:23.761 --> 13:25.179
I was too naive.

13:26.639 --> 13:30.100
It didn't matter whether the demon
could communicate or not.

13:31.393 --> 13:33.896
All they wanted was to kill me.

13:34.605 --> 13:37.274
I'm sorry, Nezuko.

13:39.401 --> 13:41.779
I couldn't find the way

13:43.697 --> 13:45.241
to turn you back into human.

13:51.413 --> 13:53.332
I feel so heavy with the given uniform.

13:54.333 --> 13:56.460
I wanted to go home earlier,

13:57.044 --> 13:58.754
but my whole body hurts.

14:27.533 --> 14:28.659
I'm finally here.

14:29.535 --> 14:32.162
Nezuko, Master Urokodaki.

14:43.424 --> 14:44.675
Nezuko!

14:44.925 --> 14:47.761
You're awake!

14:50.931 --> 14:51.974
Nezuko.

14:53.684 --> 14:55.185
It hurts.

15:05.487 --> 15:09.199
Why did you suddenly fall asleep?

15:10.034 --> 15:12.244
Plus, you never wake up after that.

15:14.371 --> 15:16.790
I thought you were dead!

15:24.173 --> 15:27.217
Thank goodness, you came back alive.

15:40.022 --> 15:43.567
I see. You killed the morphed demon.

15:44.109 --> 15:45.152
Yes.

15:47.196 --> 15:48.572
Finally.

15:50.908 --> 15:53.202
It's so great that you came home alive.

15:53.577 --> 15:54.578
Yes.

15:57.081 --> 16:00.376
There are several types of demons.

16:01.126 --> 16:04.880
There are demons who can use a type
of special spells, Blood Demon Arts.

16:04.964 --> 16:06.423
Those are the so-called caster demons.

16:08.550 --> 16:12.346
You will probably fight
against those demons later.

16:13.013 --> 16:18.060
Fighting against them will be harder
than what you have experienced.

16:19.269 --> 16:20.938
But Tanjiro,

16:21.355 --> 16:23.691
you'll definitely be fine.

16:25.401 --> 16:26.485
Yes.

16:28.612 --> 16:29.655
Well,

16:29.905 --> 16:33.158
I think Nezuko is different
from the other demons.

16:33.701 --> 16:36.912
Is she the spell-casting type
that you said?

16:37.287 --> 16:39.790
No, I don't think so.

16:40.374 --> 16:43.669
I don't think she's a demon
who practices Blood Demon Arts.

16:44.837 --> 16:46.964
This is just my guess.

16:47.339 --> 16:50.467
Nezuko uses sleep to compensate

16:50.718 --> 16:51.969
for not consuming human flesh.

16:52.094 --> 16:54.805
Maybe she's using this method
to regain energy.

16:59.184 --> 17:02.104
I'll protect Nezuko.

17:11.363 --> 17:14.908
FIFTEEN DAYS LATER

17:30.674 --> 17:31.925
You are...

17:32.051 --> 17:34.428
I'm Haganezuka.

17:34.970 --> 17:37.556
Tanjiro Kamado's sword is ready.

17:37.765 --> 17:39.183
I came here to deliver it.

17:42.227 --> 17:45.272
Well, I'm Tanjiro Kamado.

17:45.981 --> 17:47.024
Please come in.

17:47.107 --> 17:48.734
This is a Nichirin blade.

17:49.401 --> 17:51.236
I forged this sword.

17:51.320 --> 17:52.362
Well...

17:52.613 --> 17:54.281
I'll make tea now. Please come in--

17:54.364 --> 17:56.158
The raw materials of a Nichirin blade

17:56.241 --> 17:58.994
are mined from the mountain
nearest to the sun.

18:00.120 --> 18:03.832
Scarlet Crimson Iron Sand
and Scarlet Crimson Ore.

18:04.124 --> 18:08.128
Thus, the forged steel
can absorb sunlight.

18:08.629 --> 18:10.047
I see.

18:10.547 --> 18:14.259
Because Sunlight Mountain is perpetually
bathed in sunlight throughout the year.

18:15.344 --> 18:17.513
-It doesn't rain or snow on the mountain.
-As always...

18:17.596 --> 18:20.307
-It's dirty. Can you stand up first?
-This guy never listens.

18:22.392 --> 18:23.560
Hyottoko mask.

18:27.397 --> 18:29.983
Aren't you the son of Kakushaku?

18:30.442 --> 18:32.736
This is really a sign of good fortune.

18:33.112 --> 18:34.071
No.

18:34.154 --> 18:36.615
I'm the son of Tanjuro and Kie.

18:37.282 --> 18:38.992
That's not what I meant.

18:39.368 --> 18:43.372
I mean you have red hair and eyes.

18:43.789 --> 18:47.084
If a family business relates to fire
and a child like you was born,

18:47.167 --> 18:50.045
it's an auspicious sign
that deserves celebration.

18:50.379 --> 18:51.672
Is that so?

18:51.755 --> 18:53.132
I didn't know that.

18:53.715 --> 18:56.718
At this rate, this sword
will most likely turn bright red.

18:57.302 --> 18:59.054
Am I right, Urokodaki?

18:59.471 --> 19:00.639
Yes.

19:05.602 --> 19:07.479
All right. Unsheathe the sword.

19:07.771 --> 19:12.568
Nichirin blade is also known
as the color-changing sword.

19:12.901 --> 19:15.863
The sword will change its color
depending on the owner.

19:43.515 --> 19:44.516
It's black!

19:44.600 --> 19:45.934
Black.

19:47.019 --> 19:49.146
Is there something wrong
with a black sword?

19:49.980 --> 19:51.356
Does it signify misfortune?

19:51.523 --> 19:54.526
No, there's no such thing.

19:54.610 --> 19:57.571
It's uncommon to see
such a pitch-black sword.

19:59.406 --> 20:03.160
I thought I could see a bright red sword!

20:03.493 --> 20:04.786
I'm pissed!

20:07.080 --> 20:08.332
It hurts.

20:08.415 --> 20:09.499
This is dangerous.

20:09.583 --> 20:11.126
Please calm down!

20:11.210 --> 20:12.669
How old are you this year?

20:12.753 --> 20:14.713
I'm 37 years old.

20:22.638 --> 20:24.890
Tanjiro Kamado.

20:24.973 --> 20:26.808
Listen to your mission.

20:27.935 --> 20:29.353
It's talking.

20:29.728 --> 20:32.648
Make haste to the northwestern town.

20:33.315 --> 20:36.985
Young girls have been vanishing there.

20:54.127 --> 20:56.004
Every night,

20:56.129 --> 20:58.382
young girls disappear.

20:59.424 --> 21:04.012
Find the demon hidden within
and put an end to it.

21:04.554 --> 21:06.098
Tanjiro Kamado.

21:06.348 --> 21:08.433
Exercise caution.

21:09.101 --> 21:13.814
This will be your first mission
as a demon slayer.

21:14.731 --> 21:17.317
First mission.

22:52.871 --> 22:55.499
Kasugai Crow, say hello to everyone.

22:55.665 --> 22:58.627
You don't have a right to order me around.

22:58.794 --> 23:01.213
-It hurts!
-Darn you, kid.

23:04.216 --> 23:05.342
My goodness.

23:06.051 --> 23:09.012
Here's a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

23:09.179 --> 23:11.515
Cut the crap! Do your mission now.

23:11.598 --> 23:13.308
Move it!

23:13.600 --> 23:16.103
I know.

23:17.479 --> 23:20.440
Next, episode 6,
"Swordsman Accompanying a Demon."

23:20.524 --> 23:21.525
Listen carefully!

23:21.608 --> 23:24.569
If you don't watch next week's premiere,
I'll peck your head into a pulp.

23:25.487 --> 23:26.571
TO BE CONTINUED

23:26.655 --> 23:28.031
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
